---
garden: @@GARDEN@@
extends: std-vocab@@@VERSION@@
daftar_release: "@@RELEASE@@"  # the daftar release this garden runs; bin/dmupgrade.py moves it
gardener:                      # the person who keeps this garden: the id of their person bean, the garden's first
---
# @@GARDEN@@

This garden's manifest. It tells a cold agent which garden it is in, whose it is, and which vocabulary
governs it.

A garden is kept by one person — its gardener — and its first bean is them: write their person bean, then
name it above in `gardener:`. The gate asks for it as soon as the garden holds a bean. An agent tends the
garden; the gardener keeps it, and ratifies here what an agent may not decide.

A garden's identity is the commit it germinated from. Git holds it, so it is written nowhere here:
`python3 bin/dmpropose.py id` prints it, and the gate's last line shows it once the first commit is made.
